==================================================================================
  degrees [0, 3, 7]   det=2540160
  degrees [0, 2, 7]   det=705600
  degrees [0, 1, 7]   det=211680
  CONFLUENT at a0=a1=0 (derivative row): det=211680  nonzero=True -> the wall's derivative order
  degrees [0, 3, 8]   det=29030400
  degrees [0, 2, 8]   det=7741440
  degrees [0, 1, 8]   det=2257920
  CONFLUENT at a0=a1=0 (derivative row): det=2257920  nonzero=True -> the wall's derivative order
  degrees [1, 4, 9]   det=1045094400
  degrees [1, 3, 9]   det=209018880
  degrees [1, 2, 9]   det=40642560
  CONFLUENT at a0=a1=1 (derivative row): det=40642560  nonzero=True -> the wall's derivative order

  => distinct degrees: transitive channel, noncancellation. Coincident (the wall): the ordinary
     Vandermonde vanishes but the CONFLUENT (derivative/Wronskian) det survives = codex hyper-Bessel
     / my Laguerre-Polya boundary (HYP-8775). One object: the confluence of the tournament sign-sum.
